  "wikitext": "{|class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\"\n!colspan=\"2\"| Cost\n|-\n|'''Cost''' || $240, 200x [[iron]], <br/>100x [[crude oil]], 50x [[steel]]\n|-\n|'''Total Cost''' || $1,050\n|-\n!colspan=\"2\"| Production\n|-\n|'''Inputs''' || 5x [[crude oil]]\n|-\n|'''Outputs''' || 1x [[gasoline]]\n|-\n|'''Production interval''' || 30 seconds\n|-\n|'''Production/Min''' || 1x [[gasoline]]\n|-\n|'''Production/Hour'''|| 120x [[gasoline]]\n|-\n!colspan=\"2\"| Profit\n|-\n|'''Profit/Min''' || $10.00\n|-\n|'''Profit/Hour''' || $600.00\n|-\n|'''Return On Investment/Min''' || 0.857%\n|-\n|'''Time to ROI''' || 116.67 Minutes (~2Hours)\n|-\n!colspan=\"2\"| Aliases\n|-\n|colspan=\"2\"| oil refinery, oilrefinery, gas refinery, gasrefinery, gas plant, gasplant\n|}\n[[Category:Facility]]\n\nThe oil refinery is a facility that produces 1x [[gasoline]] every 30 seconds. \n\nwith 1 [[Oil well]], you can supply up to 6 [[Oil refinery]]. \n\n[[Oil refinery]] can also produce [[Jet fuel]] when you install [[Jet fuel refining]] tech.\n\n==== Export ====\n\ngasoline needed for exporting asset between region. for further information, see [[Export]]\n\n== Related facilities ==\n'''As input'''\n*[[Gas station]]\n\n== Related Blueprints ==\n*[[Jet fuel refining]]",
