  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$240, 200x <a href=\"/index.php/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">iron</a>, <br />100x <a href=\"/index.php/Crude_oil\" title=\"Crude oil\">crude oil</a>, 50x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$1,050\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Production\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>5x <a href=\"/index.php/Crude_oil\" title=\"Crude oil\">crude oil</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>1x <a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline\" title=\"Gasoline\">gasoline</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>30 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\n<td>1x <a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline\" title=\"Gasoline\">gasoline</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Hour</b></td>\n<td>120x <a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline\" title=\"Gasoline\">gasoline</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Profit\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$10.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$600.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment/Min</b></td>\n<td>0.857%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Time to ROI</b></td>\n<td>116.67 Minutes (~2Hours)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Aliases\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">oil refinery, oilrefinery, gas refinery, gasrefinery, gas plant, gasplant\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The oil refinery is a facility that produces 1x <a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline\" title=\"Gasoline\">gasoline</a> every 30 seconds. \n</p><p>with 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Oil_well\" title=\"Oil well\">Oil well</a>, you can supply up to 6 <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Oil refinery</a>. \n</p><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Oil refinery</a> can also produce <a href=\"/index.php/Jet_fuel\" title=\"Jet fuel\">Jet fuel</a> when you install <a href=\"/index.php/Jet_fuel_refining\" title=\"Jet fuel refining\">Jet fuel refining</a> tech.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Export\">Export</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Oil_refinery&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Export\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>gasoline needed for exporting asset between region. for further information, see <a href=\"/index.php/Export\" title=\"Export\">Export</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Oil_refinery&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>As input</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Gas_station\" title=\"Gas station\">Gas station</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Blueprints\">Related Blueprints</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Oil_refinery&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Related Blueprints\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Jet_fuel_refining\" title=\"Jet fuel refining\">Jet fuel refining</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008163256\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion e